      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does a typical move from Bangalore to Bhadrak take for Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The transit distance of roughly 850 km is covered in 12‑14 hours of driving under normal traffic conditions. Including loading, unloading, and checkpoint clearances, the complete end‑to‑end service usually completes within 2 days, ensuring a swift yet safe relocation.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required to book an intercity relocation from Bangalore to Bhadrak?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Customers need a valid government‑issued ID, address proof for both origin and destination, GSTIN (if corporate), and a signed moving agreement. For vehicle transport, registration certificates and insurance papers are also required. All documents are verified before the IBA‑approved bill is generated.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 100% insurance claim process work if any item gets damaged during the Bangalore‑Bhadrak move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad provides IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering the full declared value. In case of damage, the client files a claim within 48 hours, submits photographic evidence and the original invoice, and the insurer processes reimbursement within 7‑10 business days, ensuring hassle‑free compensation.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there extra charges for transporting two‑wheelers or cars on the Bangalore to Bhadrak route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Two‑wheelers are moved on dedicated carriers with wheel chocks and ratchet lashings at a flat rate based on engine capacity. Cars are loaded onto enclosed multi‑car trailers; pricing includes a base vehicle fee plus any special handling requests. No hidden surcharges are applied beyond the quoted tariff.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures are taken at checkposts and during transit on the Bangalore‑Bhadrak highway?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our fleet follows a pre‑cleared route with real‑time GPS monitoring. At each checkpoint, drivers present IBA‑approved bills and vehicle permits, while the support team coordinates with authorities to minimize delays. All cargo is secured with high‑tensile lashings and monitored by 24/7 CCTV at our warehousing hubs.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does IBA approval benefit me when I settle the moving bill for a Bangalore‑Bhadrak relocation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">IBA approval ensures the bill conforms to banking and corporate reimbursement standards, making it eligible for direct claim processing by banks, PSU, and government departments. The bill includes GST breakdown, detailed service description, and a unique transaction ID, simplifying audit and expense tracking.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my shipment live while it travels from Bangalore to Bhadrak?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every container truck is equipped with satellite GPS that feeds live location data to our customer portal and WhatsApp tracker. Clients receive real‑time updates on departure, checkpoint clearances, and estimated arrival, providing full visibility throughout the intercity journey.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
